      "spam": false,
      "value": "Would also be great to be able to set a particle collider on any object. So say having a button on map that needs to be shot at (with some particle) to trigger it's script. This is possible in MonoBehaviour.OnParticleCollision but only when particles are configured to have collision and trigger, which aren't on by default and most don't activate them :'(",
